WEBVTT

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.158 --> 01:47.064
=Episode 22=
(Your Dad's Strong Alcohol)

01:51.806 --> 01:52.806
Who is it?

01:57.565 --> 01:58.966
Hurry, Xingqi, come in.

01:59.525 --> 02:01.446
- Luzhou.
- Ms. Mei.

02:01.766 --> 02:02.766
Give it to me.

02:03.485 --> 02:04.485
Come on.

02:05.165 --> 02:06.485
When you finish your homework,

02:06.926 --> 02:08.085
I'll take you to the park.

02:09.165 --> 02:10.366
Keep your word.

02:11.766 --> 02:12.806
Don't run off.

02:13.205 --> 02:14.645
Your dad is waiting for you.

02:15.286 --> 02:15.965
Not now.

02:16.045 --> 02:17.045
You brat.

02:19.286 --> 02:20.605
Ms. Mei, here you are.

02:20.926 --> 02:21.926
I'll be going now.

02:22.125 --> 02:23.605
Where are you going, Luzhou?

02:23.846 --> 02:25.125
You haven't been back for long.

02:25.446 --> 02:26.886
I'll pour you a glass of water.

02:27.045 --> 02:28.045
Come on.

02:29.726 --> 02:30.726
Come on.

02:33.886 --> 02:35.286
I'll go get some fruit.

02:42.525 --> 02:43.525
I have brought him here.

02:44.165 --> 02:45.645
I'll be going now.

02:47.045 --> 02:48.125
Aren't you going to sit?

02:50.286 --> 02:51.286
No.

02:51.966 --> 02:52.966
Luzhou,

03:04.565 --> 03:05.565
I know,

03:05.846 --> 03:07.446
it's too late to say anything now.

03:08.366 --> 03:09.926
But I still want to tell you,

03:12.366 --> 03:13.685
being your dad,

03:14.565 --> 03:15.565
I am very honored.

03:19.966 --> 03:21.286
From a young age till now,

03:21.886 --> 03:23.766
you have been smarter
and more understanding

03:24.085 --> 03:25.085
than your peers.

03:26.045 --> 03:27.565
You've never made me worry.

03:29.565 --> 03:31.446
The fact that you're
growing up day by day,

03:31.766 --> 03:32.926
excelling in your schoolwork,

03:34.045 --> 03:35.766
has made me

03:35.926 --> 03:37.766
the envy of other parents.

03:39.926 --> 03:41.525
I am truly proud of you.

03:45.846 --> 03:47.406
In contrast,

03:49.045 --> 03:51.525
I have really been a terrible father.

03:54.366 --> 03:56.605
I didn't manage the relationship
with your mom well,

03:57.726 --> 03:58.966
and I insisted

04:00.366 --> 04:01.726
on sending you abroad.

04:04.286 --> 04:06.565
Now even Xingqi won't talk to me.

04:13.326 --> 04:15.366
It was me who destroyed this family.

04:19.766 --> 04:21.326
Let's not mention the past anymore.

04:26.726 --> 04:27.726
Xingqi

04:28.726 --> 04:29.926
is just in a rebellious phase.

04:31.806 --> 04:33.045
Show him more care.

04:47.286 --> 04:48.286
Luzhou,

04:49.446 --> 04:50.565
no matter what,

04:52.326 --> 04:54.005
this will always be your home.

04:55.125 --> 04:56.446
Come back

04:57.446 --> 04:58.565
whenever you want.

05:13.525 --> 05:14.605
I can't accept it.

05:16.726 --> 05:17.806
Take care

05:18.246 --> 05:19.246
of your health.

05:21.005 --> 05:23.205
When I have time,
I'll visit you and Xingqi.

05:27.446 --> 05:28.645
Bye, Dad.

05:45.966 --> 05:46.966
(My boyfriend,)

05:47.205 --> 05:49.085
(Xu has me visit my grandma.)

05:49.485 --> 05:51.645
(I'm afraid I won't be back today.)

05:52.446 --> 05:53.525
(Then what should I do?)

05:57.246 --> 05:58.286
(Just bear with it.)

05:58.406 --> 05:59.645
(I'll be back soon.)

06:00.366 --> 06:02.766
(Bear with what? I mean my suitcase.)

06:05.806 --> 06:07.726
(Don't you miss me?)

06:09.205 --> 06:10.205
(I miss you too.)

06:10.326 --> 06:11.605
(But right now,)

06:12.326 --> 06:13.726
(I miss my suitcase more.)

06:16.446 --> 06:18.446
(Is there something valuable inside?)

06:22.205 --> 06:23.205
(My underwear.)

06:30.565 --> 06:32.565
(So can you come back tomorrow?)

06:34.246 --> 06:35.326
(It's up to my dad.)

06:35.525 --> 06:36.367
(If he stays,)

06:36.447 --> 06:38.326
(I can't just run back
by myself, right?)

06:39.766 --> 06:40.766
(I see that.)

06:41.165 --> 06:42.645
(Your dad did it on purpose.)

06:44.926 --> 06:47.565
Hey, hey, hey.

06:48.685 --> 06:50.645
I have already wiped dry over there.

06:57.246 --> 06:58.246
What's wrong?

06:58.406 --> 06:59.766
Xu,

06:59.886 --> 07:00.966
you do this on purpose?

07:02.246 --> 07:04.485
I just think that brat is dumb.

07:04.966 --> 07:07.165
He said that
because he's afraid you can't accept it.

07:07.685 --> 07:09.446
I can't accept it?

07:11.165 --> 07:13.005
I'm not against you dating.

07:13.926 --> 07:15.726
Be it a boyfriend or a husband,

07:16.806 --> 07:18.366
it must be built on

07:18.446 --> 07:19.886
the foundation of mutual attraction.

07:19.966 --> 07:20.485
Right?

07:20.565 --> 07:22.686
But such a foundation
is with conditions.

07:22.766 --> 07:23.766
You need to understand.

07:26.165 --> 07:27.205
I roughly understand.

07:28.286 --> 07:29.726
You guys are young now,

07:29.806 --> 07:30.647
but over time,

07:30.727 --> 07:32.485
this attraction will change.

07:33.005 --> 07:34.886
If this guy
has a sense of responsibility,

07:35.165 --> 07:36.205
that's good.

07:36.446 --> 07:37.565
If not,

07:37.645 --> 07:38.645
he may cheat

07:38.806 --> 07:40.605
or refuse to marry you.

07:40.685 --> 07:42.565
Isn't it just wasting your time?

07:42.645 --> 07:44.045
Chen Luzhou wouldn't do that.

07:45.286 --> 07:46.326
I know he wouldn't.

07:46.685 --> 07:47.685
On the contrary,

07:48.525 --> 07:49.846
I actually think highly of him.

07:50.125 --> 07:51.205
I feel

07:51.406 --> 07:53.766
he's more mature than your peers.

07:55.565 --> 07:57.605
But you're my daughter.

07:58.085 --> 08:00.806
If I don't take this opportunity
to point out his flaws to establish

08:01.045 --> 08:01.766
my authority,

08:01.886 --> 08:02.605
in the future,

08:02.726 --> 08:03.926
what if he treats you bad?

08:04.645 --> 08:06.085
Break his leg.

08:08.525 --> 08:09.886
A thumbs up to you.

08:11.406 --> 08:12.406
Dad,

08:12.605 --> 08:13.925
Chen Luzhou is already subdued

08:14.005 --> 08:15.446
by your authority.

08:16.365 --> 08:17.606
He really said that.

08:19.526 --> 08:20.245
It worked.

08:20.526 --> 08:21.526
So,

08:21.606 --> 08:23.365
when do you plan to return his suitcase?

08:23.445 --> 08:24.486
Don't worry.

08:24.726 --> 08:27.726
I never planned
to make things difficult for him.

08:29.325 --> 08:31.526
Dry the area you wet yourself.

08:31.886 --> 08:32.886
Got it.

08:45.165 --> 08:46.165
Who is it?

08:52.486 --> 08:53.486
Mr. Fu.

08:55.125 --> 08:56.846
I heard you don't have underwear.

08:59.646 --> 09:00.686
Xu Zhi told you, right?

09:08.165 --> 09:09.165
Thank you.

09:10.526 --> 09:12.285
Won't you invite me in for a cup of tea?

09:17.205 --> 09:18.205
Please.

09:19.165 --> 09:20.165
Um...

09:27.566 --> 09:29.005
There's no... no tea at home.

09:29.646 --> 09:30.646
Is water okay?

09:31.045 --> 09:32.045
No problem.

09:49.085 --> 09:50.085
That table...

09:58.766 --> 10:00.045
Sorry about that.

10:00.886 --> 10:01.966
Your table...

10:08.846 --> 10:10.526
Why are there mechanisms

10:10.726 --> 10:11.726
everywhere?

10:12.445 --> 10:13.445
This is for you.

10:17.245 --> 10:18.245
Well,

10:20.966 --> 10:22.245
I heard from Xu Zhi

10:23.486 --> 10:24.486
that you two are dating.

10:25.846 --> 10:29.285
Yes, is there a problem with that?

10:32.405 --> 10:33.526
There's no big problem.

10:35.125 --> 10:36.125
But

10:38.285 --> 10:40.245
there are indeed a few small problems.

10:47.486 --> 10:49.085
Have you ever

10:50.365 --> 10:51.405
been in love before?

10:54.445 --> 10:55.445
No.

10:57.445 --> 10:58.445
Impossible.

11:02.165 --> 11:03.846
Really, you're not fooling me?

11:03.926 --> 11:04.926
Forget it.

11:06.606 --> 11:07.326
After asking this,

11:07.406 --> 11:08.726
shouldn't you ask about family?

11:10.365 --> 11:12.045
I don't care about family issues.

11:12.245 --> 11:14.045
Everyone has family issues.

11:14.125 --> 11:15.566
And it doesn't change anything.

11:16.085 --> 11:18.205
If someone asks
about your family background,

11:18.285 --> 11:20.686
it's just to see if you have money.

11:22.445 --> 11:23.445
But,

11:23.566 --> 11:24.966
even if you don't have money now,

11:25.445 --> 11:27.566
you and Xu Zhi are both top students.

11:27.966 --> 11:29.606
After graduation,

11:30.085 --> 11:31.085
I believe

11:31.526 --> 11:32.806
you'll live better.

11:36.285 --> 11:37.365
What I care about

11:41.926 --> 11:43.606
is the issue concerning men.

11:45.486 --> 11:46.966
With conditions as good as yours,

11:50.285 --> 11:52.445
it's normal if you go out and have fun.

11:52.606 --> 11:53.606
I can understand.

11:54.766 --> 11:55.766
But,

11:56.165 --> 11:57.966
if you go out and have fun,

11:58.365 --> 12:00.486
don't hold Xu Zhi back.

12:01.486 --> 12:03.365
I don't want to see

12:04.085 --> 12:06.886
the prodigal return with you two.

12:09.045 --> 12:10.646
Mr. Fu, do I look like a prodigal?

12:10.806 --> 12:14.205
A little.

12:15.726 --> 12:17.886
Want me to say you're handsome?

12:18.045 --> 12:19.045
Not really.

12:20.005 --> 12:21.566
Mr. Fu, when you were young,

12:22.405 --> 12:24.125
you must have been quite handsome.

12:24.966 --> 12:25.966
Are you a prodigal?

12:31.966 --> 12:32.966
You're quite smart.

12:36.646 --> 12:37.646
I won't say much more.

12:37.846 --> 12:39.045
You know what I mean.

12:45.165 --> 12:46.445
I'll take my leave first.

12:53.806 --> 12:55.045
Won't drink the water, Mr. Fu?

12:58.005 --> 12:59.005
No.

13:00.165 --> 13:01.445
I'm afraid you'll poison me.

13:07.045 --> 13:09.085
Take care, I won't see you off.

13:25.165 --> 13:26.285
Dad, have some water.

13:28.606 --> 13:29.205
And you?

13:29.285 --> 13:30.325
Not thirsty.

13:50.686 --> 13:51.686
Xu,

13:52.245 --> 13:53.846
about Ms. Wei,

13:54.125 --> 13:55.165
does my grandma know?

13:55.646 --> 13:56.646
Yes, she knows.

13:56.806 --> 13:57.966
I told her before New Year.

13:59.005 --> 14:00.766
Well, you kept it from me.

14:01.486 --> 14:03.045
Didn't you keep your secret too?

14:07.365 --> 14:08.526
In a couple of days,

14:08.686 --> 14:10.526
let's invite Ms. Wei

14:10.846 --> 14:11.846
and Luzhou.

14:12.966 --> 14:14.325
If we are busy,

14:14.806 --> 14:15.727
we won't meet much.

14:15.807 --> 14:16.846
Since we are all home now,

14:16.966 --> 14:18.526
let's have a meal and meet up.

14:18.846 --> 14:20.526
Okay, I'll tell him.

14:37.165 --> 14:38.165
Ms. Wei.

14:39.766 --> 14:41.486
I just happened to bump into him.

14:41.566 --> 14:42.886
Great, come in please.

14:43.445 --> 14:44.846
- After you.
- Okay.

14:44.926 --> 14:45.925
Slippers.

14:46.005 --> 14:46.846
Happy New Year.

14:46.926 --> 14:47.926
Thank you.

14:48.926 --> 14:49.926
Thank you.

14:51.486 --> 14:52.806
Xu is cooking inside, right?

14:52.886 --> 14:53.446
Yes, yes.

14:53.526 --> 14:54.526
I'll go help.

14:56.966 --> 14:58.486
- Here you are.
- Come in.

14:59.205 --> 15:00.646
Is there anything I can help with?

15:00.726 --> 15:02.245
The slippers are a bit small.

15:02.325 --> 15:03.125
I'll do it.

15:03.205 --> 15:04.205
It's okay.

15:06.405 --> 15:07.405
For me?

15:08.005 --> 15:09.526
No, it's for your dad.

15:10.005 --> 15:11.245
So thoughtful.

15:11.766 --> 15:12.766
Are you nervous?

15:13.165 --> 15:13.887
Of course not.

15:13.967 --> 15:15.205
I've been through much.

15:17.125 --> 15:19.405
Stop messing around, let's go.

15:22.365 --> 15:23.365
Just put it up there.

15:23.486 --> 15:25.085
- Come on.
- Thank you.

15:26.526 --> 15:28.766
Luzhou, try this one.

15:29.686 --> 15:30.686
Okay.

15:33.886 --> 15:34.886
Is it bland?

15:35.486 --> 15:36.445
- Is it okay?
- Yes.

15:36.566 --> 15:38.005
- Delicious.
- Try that one.

15:38.325 --> 15:39.325
Salty herb chicken.

15:40.045 --> 15:41.045
See if it's salty.

15:45.846 --> 15:46.846
How is it?

15:46.966 --> 15:50.325
Salty. No, it's just right.

15:50.846 --> 15:51.966
It is fine.

15:52.285 --> 15:53.446
I worried it'll be too salty.

15:53.526 --> 15:54.526
The ribs are here.

15:55.285 --> 15:56.285
The dishes are all here.

15:57.646 --> 15:59.806
Come on, try this.

16:00.005 --> 16:01.165
Are these ribs sweet?

16:01.766 --> 16:02.766
Alright.

16:03.365 --> 16:06.245
Are you here to taste the dishes?

16:08.486 --> 16:09.566
I just want to see

16:09.726 --> 16:10.886
if you and Zhi get along

16:10.966 --> 16:12.085
when it comes to food.

16:12.325 --> 16:13.005
Absolutely.

16:13.325 --> 16:14.726
I love everything she loves to eat.

16:14.926 --> 16:15.926
That's good then.

16:16.285 --> 16:16.886
Cheers.

16:17.165 --> 16:18.926
Cheers, Mr. Xu.

16:19.125 --> 16:20.125
Can you drink?

16:20.566 --> 16:21.566
Of course.

16:26.445 --> 16:27.445
Good.

16:28.405 --> 16:29.405
Xu Zhi,

16:29.606 --> 16:31.486
open the gift I give you
and take a look.

16:31.566 --> 16:32.566
Okay.

16:33.005 --> 16:34.085
There's a gift?

16:34.165 --> 16:35.165
I didn't even know.

16:35.646 --> 16:36.646
What did you buy?

16:36.806 --> 16:38.045
- It's a secret.
- You'll see.

16:41.085 --> 16:42.406
What is it?

16:42.486 --> 16:43.486
It's not a cake, is it?

16:48.165 --> 16:49.365
It's so beautiful.

16:49.445 --> 16:50.445
Really?

16:50.606 --> 16:52.886
Xu showed me pictures of you
when you were little.

16:53.085 --> 16:54.526
I see you like motorcycles.

16:54.686 --> 16:57.005
And you had many pictures
of riding motorcycles.

16:57.245 --> 16:59.205
I think you must like it.

16:59.566 --> 17:01.085
Take a look.

17:01.245 --> 17:02.886
- Good.
- Look at it from all angles.

17:04.005 --> 17:06.245
Indeed, you are
much more considerate than me.

17:06.325 --> 17:06.965
That's good.

17:07.045 --> 17:08.205
- Looks good.
- I like it.

17:08.365 --> 17:09.365
Try it.

17:09.646 --> 17:10.646
Extra large.

17:11.285 --> 17:12.646
I wear an extra small.

17:13.205 --> 17:14.205
Um...

17:14.325 --> 17:15.325
I didn't know

17:15.445 --> 17:16.445
and bought a wrong size.

17:16.606 --> 17:17.766
I'll go buy a new one.

17:17.846 --> 17:18.846
No need, no need.

17:19.045 --> 17:20.165
I quite like this one.

17:20.285 --> 17:22.445
And if I can't wear it,

17:23.405 --> 17:24.806
he can wear it instead.

17:25.365 --> 17:27.085
It suits him.

17:27.205 --> 17:27.807
- Yes.
- Good.

17:27.887 --> 17:29.165
I like pink.

17:29.325 --> 17:31.285
Then I'll go buy another one
in a smaller size.

17:31.365 --> 17:32.365
No need to spend more.

17:32.445 --> 17:33.445
This one is just fine.

17:34.205 --> 17:35.606
Come on, it's a good occasion.

17:35.686 --> 17:37.125
Come on, cheers.

17:37.285 --> 17:38.365
I must buy it, come on.

17:40.005 --> 17:40.566
Cheers.

17:40.886 --> 17:41.686
Happy New Year.

17:41.886 --> 17:42.966
Happy New Year.

17:54.445 --> 17:55.846
- Chen Luzhou.
- Here.

17:56.285 --> 17:58.245
Do you know how to tie ponytails?

17:59.606 --> 18:00.606
No, I don't.

18:01.846 --> 18:02.846
Zhi,

18:03.726 --> 18:06.205
bring over that vase.

18:06.405 --> 18:07.566
What vase?

18:07.846 --> 18:09.925
The one that you put

18:10.005 --> 18:11.365
those colorful hair ties in.

18:12.806 --> 18:13.806
Where did you put it?

18:16.205 --> 18:17.205
There, there.

18:20.285 --> 18:21.285
Here.

18:22.405 --> 18:23.405
This is it.

18:24.486 --> 18:26.005
They are really pretty.

18:27.205 --> 18:31.005
Today, I'll share our family's

18:31.085 --> 18:33.926
traditional ponytail tying technique

18:35.486 --> 18:36.486
with you.

18:41.245 --> 18:42.245
Don't be nervous.

18:42.766 --> 18:44.445
Sometimes,
you just have to endure things.

18:44.646 --> 18:46.165
Do it on me?

18:46.245 --> 18:47.245
Of course.

18:47.726 --> 18:49.005
You should experience it.

18:49.085 --> 18:50.365
This ponytail should be placed

18:50.445 --> 18:52.325
at the best position, right?

18:54.045 --> 18:55.205
It cannot

18:55.766 --> 18:57.445
be tied too low.

18:57.806 --> 18:59.806
Also, it can't be too high.

18:59.886 --> 19:01.205
Just at this height,

19:01.285 --> 19:02.686
it is the best.

19:03.405 --> 19:05.606
But the hair must be smooth.

19:05.686 --> 19:07.726
Smooth it down along the hair.

19:09.005 --> 19:11.325
Luzhou, your hair is a bit short.

19:14.846 --> 19:15.846
Don't move.

19:16.445 --> 19:17.446
Okay, almost done.

19:17.526 --> 19:19.205
Luzhou, want me to help you?

19:19.285 --> 19:19.847
It's okay.

19:19.927 --> 19:21.526
I actually also want to learn.

19:21.726 --> 19:22.726
No, that's not right.

19:24.205 --> 19:25.566
You've got to be quick.

19:25.686 --> 19:27.325
If you're slow, she'll feel pain.

19:34.205 --> 19:35.205
This time it worked.

19:43.085 --> 19:44.926
You remember all these, right?

19:45.846 --> 19:47.886
It looks good at certain positions.

19:48.526 --> 19:50.566
While it looks less appealing

19:50.846 --> 19:51.846
- somewhere.
- Got it.

19:53.686 --> 19:54.686
Good.

19:55.245 --> 19:56.486
I am satisfied.

19:58.806 --> 20:00.846
He's usually like this when he's drunk?

20:01.125 --> 20:02.365
I'll help him in.

20:04.125 --> 20:07.606
I remembered another one.

20:08.365 --> 20:09.405
It's faster.

20:09.886 --> 20:10.886
In case in the future,

20:11.846 --> 20:13.245
she is late for work

20:13.325 --> 20:14.806
or school,

20:15.045 --> 20:16.045
remember

20:16.285 --> 20:17.646
this method.

20:18.005 --> 20:19.646
You'll be able to leave quickly.

20:21.566 --> 20:22.766
Goodbye, Mr. Xu.

20:23.005 --> 20:24.606
Take it slow.

20:25.686 --> 20:26.686
Xu Zhi, it's okay.

20:26.806 --> 20:27.846
You go see Luzhou off.

20:27.926 --> 20:29.005
I'll take care of Xu.

20:29.966 --> 20:31.085
Thank you, Ms. Wei.

20:31.606 --> 20:32.646
Goodbye, Ms. Wei.

20:32.806 --> 20:33.405
Goodbye.

20:33.566 --> 20:34.566
Hold this for me.

20:37.125 --> 20:38.646
I can also help you put on your shoes.

20:39.646 --> 20:40.886
I put on shoes for you, okay?

20:41.325 --> 20:42.365
They're already on.

20:46.125 --> 20:47.365
Be careful on your way back.

20:47.806 --> 20:48.365
Bye-bye.

20:48.766 --> 20:49.766
I'm leaving.

20:52.566 --> 20:53.886
- I'll carry you.
- Come on.

20:54.766 --> 20:55.766
I was just kidding.

21:00.405 --> 21:02.795
Zhi,

21:02.795 --> 21:07.566
help me charge it.

21:10.405 --> 21:11.926
- Thank you.
- Can I take a look?

21:13.005 --> 21:14.005
Check on me?

21:14.205 --> 21:15.205
I can't?

21:16.606 --> 21:18.526
Go ahead. The password's your birthday.

21:21.405 --> 21:22.405
Then forget it.

21:22.966 --> 21:24.726
If you use my birthday as the password,

21:24.806 --> 21:26.846
you have no shady secrets.

21:29.165 --> 21:30.646
If you want to check, go ahead.

21:31.045 --> 21:32.846
All my passwords
are your birthday anyway,

21:35.806 --> 21:37.686
except for the house
and bank card passwords.

21:37.846 --> 21:39.766
I'm most concerned about
the bank card password.

21:43.806 --> 21:48.766
Alright, money-grubber.

21:49.445 --> 21:50.686
The same as 903.

21:52.486 --> 21:53.486
Keep it safe.

22:22.966 --> 22:23.925
Zhi,

22:24.005 --> 22:25.325
do you have any wishes?

22:26.205 --> 22:28.165
I hope my boyfriend

22:28.245 --> 22:29.126
can transfer to

22:29.206 --> 22:30.486
his favorite major.

22:32.005 --> 22:33.365
That's an easy wish.

22:38.245 --> 22:39.766
What do you want to do in the future?

22:41.405 --> 22:42.445
What do you want me to do?

22:43.045 --> 22:44.566
Don't you have your own ideas?

22:45.405 --> 22:47.846
Yes, but I want to hear what you say.

22:50.005 --> 22:51.606
You're doing well in your studies.

22:51.966 --> 22:54.886
I think you could stay at school
as a professor after graduation.

22:55.205 --> 22:56.205
That would be great.

22:57.806 --> 22:59.085
However, I believe

23:00.646 --> 23:02.365
in the all-capable Chen Luzhou.

23:02.686 --> 23:04.365
No matter what you do,
you'll do it well.

23:05.285 --> 23:06.966
Why does this sound so familiar?

23:09.646 --> 23:10.405
You are quick.

23:10.646 --> 23:11.806
Why do you always

23:11.886 --> 23:13.806
want to pinch my cheek?

23:15.445 --> 23:17.285
What about your wishes?

23:22.886 --> 23:24.005
You guessed it all.

23:28.886 --> 23:30.966
I thought you
prepared gifts only for Xu.

23:31.846 --> 23:32.886
Spare you this time.

23:34.005 --> 23:35.005
Open it.

23:38.806 --> 23:39.846
What is this?

23:44.478 --> 23:48.498
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

23:49.606 --> 23:50.606
You made it yourself?

23:50.846 --> 23:55.806
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

23:55.886 --> 23:56.886
Do you like it?

23:57.085 --> 23:58.606
You're quite resourceful and skillful.

24:06.926 --> 24:07.926
I found out,

24:09.245 --> 24:11.325
your dad's alcohol is really strong.

24:12.886 --> 24:14.726
It's so strong
I almost want to bow to my mom.

24:15.846 --> 24:17.886
If she hadn't attracted you,

24:18.405 --> 24:20.606
you wouldn't have gone
to great lengths to approach me.

24:21.405 --> 24:23.045
Then you also have to bow to Tan Xu.

24:24.005 --> 24:25.486
Without him,

24:26.245 --> 24:27.325
we wouldn't have met.

24:27.846 --> 24:29.125
Stop giving me trouble, alright?

24:32.325 --> 24:33.325
Just kidding.

24:33.566 --> 24:34.566
So petty.

24:41.245 --> 24:42.526
Shy Boy Chen,

24:42.846 --> 24:43.886
I love you.

24:46.005 --> 24:47.005
Me too.

24:51.070 --> 24:53.760
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

24:54.302 --> 25:00.600
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

25:00.990 --> 25:03.794
♪The lonely clock♪

25:04.030 --> 25:08.974
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

25:09.054 --> 25:12.409
♪Are we both♪

25:12.702 --> 25:16.184
♪Attracted to each other♪

25:17.445 --> 25:18.445
Goodnight.

25:20.766 --> 25:23.459
♪Falling into you♪

25:26.926 --> 25:29.045
Dad, last night, you...

25:29.726 --> 25:31.606
Doesn't Chen Luzhou live nearby?

25:32.245 --> 25:33.766
Call him here for breakfast.

25:33.886 --> 25:34.966
He isn't up yet.

25:36.486 --> 25:39.405
A top student from Huaguang University,
sleeping in like this.

25:39.846 --> 25:41.085
How will he take care of you?

25:41.806 --> 25:43.325
He isn't late every day.

25:43.966 --> 25:45.405
He works hard at school.

25:46.926 --> 25:47.527
Do you remember

25:47.607 --> 25:49.245
what you did last night?

25:50.966 --> 25:52.245
Ms. Wei told me.

25:53.445 --> 25:55.165
Chen Luzhou won't be mad, will he?

25:55.445 --> 25:56.806
I tied so many ponytails.

25:57.205 --> 25:58.766
No, he has a great temper.

25:59.846 --> 26:01.165
Having a good temper is good.

26:02.686 --> 26:03.966
Ms. Wei also praised him

26:04.686 --> 26:05.886
for his politeness.

26:06.566 --> 26:07.646
She said she noticed

26:07.926 --> 26:09.606
whenever she talked to Chen Luzhou,

26:10.285 --> 26:11.086
he would

26:11.166 --> 26:12.245
put down his chopsticks

26:12.325 --> 26:13.526
and listen carefully to her.

26:14.325 --> 26:16.045
Ms. Wei is so attentive.

26:16.405 --> 26:17.405
If she hadn't told me,

26:17.606 --> 26:18.686
I wouldn't have known.

26:19.726 --> 26:20.806
Are you praising Luzhou

26:20.886 --> 26:22.245
or Ms. Wei?

26:24.205 --> 26:25.526
What do you think of Ms. Wei?

26:25.926 --> 26:27.646
She's nice, very gentle.

26:27.846 --> 26:29.766
She seems very caring.

26:31.846 --> 26:34.726
Yes, I think Chen Luzhou is good too.

26:34.886 --> 26:36.926
He'll definitely be a good husband
in the future.

26:40.806 --> 26:41.486
Once you've

26:41.806 --> 26:42.567
finished eating,

26:42.647 --> 26:43.886
deliver it while it's hot.

26:51.325 --> 26:52.325
What's wrong?

26:53.005 --> 26:55.125
You care more about him than me.

26:56.365 --> 26:58.005
Are you even jealous of this?

26:58.806 --> 27:00.966
Of course, I'd be jealous of this.

27:03.245 --> 27:04.325
Have you finished eating?

27:04.606 --> 27:05.806
If you're done, go deliver it.

27:06.806 --> 27:08.846
Otherwise, my sincerity
would have cooled down.

27:10.486 --> 27:11.486
We have everything.

27:12.686 --> 27:13.446
Anything else?

27:13.526 --> 27:14.486
Do you want jelly?

27:14.566 --> 27:15.566
Yes.

27:15.686 --> 27:16.726
Yellow peach jelly?

27:16.966 --> 27:17.965
Okay.

27:18.045 --> 27:19.405
Just take one packet, this one.

27:20.365 --> 27:21.365
Mixed flavors.

27:24.846 --> 27:26.486
I want to buy a gift for Ms. Wei.

27:26.566 --> 27:27.966
But I don't know what to buy.

27:28.726 --> 27:29.806
Figured it out so quickly?

27:30.606 --> 27:32.165
I think Xu has had a hard time.

27:36.245 --> 27:37.245
Do you know?

27:37.926 --> 27:39.245
When I first got my period,

27:39.325 --> 27:40.365
I couldn't get pads.

27:40.646 --> 27:41.966
It was hard to tell Xu.

27:42.245 --> 27:43.886
When I asked Cai Yingying for help,

27:43.966 --> 27:44.486
I found out

27:44.886 --> 27:46.566
Xu had already prepared it for me.

27:46.806 --> 27:49.285
and placed it in the drawer
of our bathroom.

27:52.285 --> 27:54.365
These years, he's worked so hard.

27:54.486 --> 27:55.486
It's indeed not easy.

27:56.045 --> 27:57.846
It's actually quite nice
to have Ms. Wei.

27:58.085 --> 27:59.125
When I'm not around,

27:59.205 --> 28:01.125
she can help take care of my dad.

28:04.205 --> 28:05.205
Don't worry.

28:05.486 --> 28:07.766
From now on,
this honorable task is mine.

28:08.486 --> 28:09.486
Which one do you want?

28:10.245 --> 28:11.486
Are you stupid?

28:11.766 --> 28:12.766
Let's go, let's go.

28:14.245 --> 28:15.245
Then I'll pay the bill.

28:27.405 --> 28:28.806
Why did you come back so soon?

28:29.886 --> 28:30.886
Forgot something?

28:35.125 --> 28:36.886
X-Xu.

28:37.686 --> 28:38.686
Lian Hui.

28:39.566 --> 28:40.205
How...

28:40.365 --> 28:41.365
How did you...

28:41.566 --> 28:42.806
How did you find this place?

28:43.966 --> 28:44.526
Well.

28:44.926 --> 28:46.325
This is your home?

29:00.886 --> 29:02.405
The house is small.

29:02.966 --> 29:03.966
Not at all.

29:04.445 --> 29:06.365
Xu, I really didn't expect

29:07.165 --> 29:08.365
Xu Zhi is your daughter.

29:08.445 --> 29:10.285
I never thought of it.

29:10.606 --> 29:12.486
She really does resemble you
in some ways.

29:13.005 --> 29:15.606
I'm still stunned

29:15.686 --> 29:17.846
that Luzhou is your child.

29:19.165 --> 29:20.926
- Sit down.
- Okay, okay.

29:21.686 --> 29:22.205
Come on.

29:22.405 --> 29:23.245
I don't have much.

29:23.405 --> 29:24.205
No, it's quite fine.

29:24.285 --> 29:25.285
Have a glass of water.

29:26.005 --> 29:27.766
Actually, I heard from my youngest son

29:28.205 --> 29:30.005
Luzhou spent this New Year at your home.

29:30.526 --> 29:32.125
I just came by to say thank you

29:32.606 --> 29:34.205
and bring some gifts.

29:34.285 --> 29:35.966
I didn't expect it's such a coincidence.

29:36.325 --> 29:37.325
Yes.

29:38.606 --> 29:40.045
Thanks to your youngest son, too.

29:40.486 --> 29:41.486
We haven't

29:41.566 --> 29:43.365
seen each other for so many years.

29:46.045 --> 29:49.526
Well, Luzhou...

29:50.445 --> 29:51.445
Xu,

29:51.926 --> 29:53.766
let's not mention the past.

29:54.646 --> 29:56.325
I also don't want him to know.

29:58.846 --> 29:59.846
Alright.

30:08.526 --> 30:09.526
All these years,

30:10.365 --> 30:12.285
you've raised a kid alone.

30:12.846 --> 30:14.085
It must've been tough for you.

30:14.486 --> 30:15.486
You must be exhausted.

30:15.566 --> 30:16.566
I've managed.

30:17.646 --> 30:18.726
Your mom is at my house.

30:18.926 --> 30:19.926
She's looking for you?

30:20.125 --> 30:20.926
She shouldn't be.

30:21.125 --> 30:22.285
She doesn't know I'm here.

30:23.205 --> 30:24.566
Chen Xingqi told her?

30:25.726 --> 30:26.726
No way.

30:28.285 --> 30:29.365
I'll say the same.

30:30.526 --> 30:31.526
I just hope

30:32.405 --> 30:33.726
the mistakes I made

30:33.806 --> 30:35.325
won't affect the kids.

30:36.926 --> 30:37.926
These

30:38.526 --> 30:40.045
are best kept from them.

30:40.165 --> 30:40.726
Okay.

30:41.045 --> 30:43.165
Rest assured, I promise you.

30:45.566 --> 30:46.846
What's going on?

31:02.646 --> 31:03.646
Have you ever thought

31:03.766 --> 31:05.245
your mom is definitely not my mom,

31:06.085 --> 31:07.886
but your dad might be my dad?

31:29.325 --> 31:30.365
Why not break up first?

31:32.966 --> 31:33.566
Alright.

31:33.846 --> 31:34.846
Let's break up, then.

31:35.966 --> 31:38.125
Give up so easily?

31:38.205 --> 31:39.205
Lame.

31:39.405 --> 31:40.405
Don't worry.

31:40.686 --> 31:42.045
I won't fall in love with others.

31:42.726 --> 31:45.205
Alright, since we've broken up already,

31:45.726 --> 31:46.726
I have to go.

31:48.165 --> 31:49.325
Seriously.

31:50.405 --> 31:51.646
What's there to break up over?

31:53.045 --> 31:54.205
We break up

31:55.125 --> 31:56.125
for only one reason.

31:56.365 --> 31:57.365
What?

31:57.486 --> 31:58.486
That you don't love me.

31:59.886 --> 32:02.005
What if it really is that dramatic?

32:04.486 --> 32:05.486
Just endure it.

32:07.045 --> 32:08.085
But you don't

32:08.165 --> 32:10.405
really look like my dad.

32:11.045 --> 32:12.045
What about personality?

32:12.125 --> 32:14.045
No, not that either. Nothing is alike.

32:14.846 --> 32:17.566
Why don't I go back first

32:18.045 --> 32:19.606
and ask my dad subtly?

32:26.085 --> 32:27.085
Leaving already?

32:28.726 --> 32:29.726
Give me a kiss.

32:34.926 --> 32:35.487
No, I can't

32:35.567 --> 32:36.606
bring myself to kiss you.

32:43.325 --> 32:44.606
Dad, I'm back.

32:45.125 --> 32:46.125
You're back.

32:47.165 --> 32:48.165
Wash your hands.

32:48.566 --> 32:50.085
We can eat soon.

33:01.005 --> 33:02.005
Dad.

33:03.606 --> 33:04.606
Wait a moment.

33:09.205 --> 33:10.205
What's up?

33:12.566 --> 33:13.566
Tell me,

33:14.285 --> 33:15.526
is there a possibility

33:16.005 --> 33:17.205
that I was adopted?

33:19.646 --> 33:20.966
How did you know?

33:23.686 --> 33:24.846
Stop joking around.

33:24.926 --> 33:26.806
You started it.

33:27.205 --> 33:28.526
Go ahead, what's up?

33:29.205 --> 33:30.526
I saw news today.

33:30.766 --> 33:32.766
A person had a love child

33:32.886 --> 33:34.045
and no one knew.

33:34.285 --> 33:35.726
Later that person suddenly died,

33:35.966 --> 33:38.005
and the child inherited the legacy.

33:39.405 --> 33:40.405
Don't worry,

33:40.486 --> 33:41.726
I have no legacy,

33:42.245 --> 33:43.325
only a mortgage,

33:43.566 --> 33:44.566
and a ton of debts.

33:44.726 --> 33:45.886
Which one do you want?

34:16.766 --> 34:17.766
How is it?

34:18.806 --> 34:19.846
I only found out

34:19.926 --> 34:21.405
my dad is pretty tight-lipped today.

34:22.125 --> 34:23.846
I can't get anything out of him.

34:24.566 --> 34:25.846
I think it's impossible.

34:26.445 --> 34:27.486
That guy was a playboy.

34:27.886 --> 34:29.846
I heard he chased girls
and played with cars,

34:29.926 --> 34:31.045
and was in a coma for long.

34:31.846 --> 34:33.205
If so, my dad

34:33.285 --> 34:34.846
wouldn't do such a thing.

34:36.566 --> 34:38.446
But someone was a racer

34:38.526 --> 34:39.846
when he was young,

34:40.365 --> 34:42.325
and he was in a coma
for a couple of years.

34:42.926 --> 34:43.925
Really?

34:44.005 --> 34:45.005
Who is it?

34:46.085 --> 34:47.526
Fu Yuqing.

34:50.526 --> 34:51.526
It's time to eat.

34:52.125 --> 34:53.405
I have to go.

35:06.445 --> 35:07.726
Chen Luzhou

35:08.125 --> 35:09.365
sent you to ask me, right?

35:11.686 --> 35:12.726
You know everything, huh?

35:13.325 --> 35:14.806
How could I not know?

35:16.566 --> 35:17.926
When you were in middle school,

35:18.205 --> 35:20.405
you disliked the clothes
I paired for you

35:20.926 --> 35:22.966
and changed clothes
on the way to school.

35:23.405 --> 35:24.526
Before returning home,

35:24.606 --> 35:26.045
you changed back.

35:26.285 --> 35:27.405
Is that what happened?

35:29.566 --> 35:31.285
I thought I hid it pretty well.

35:35.966 --> 35:37.245
So is Mr. Fu actually

35:37.325 --> 35:38.526
Chen Luzhou's father?

35:44.806 --> 35:46.005
Is he?

35:49.766 --> 35:51.045
Let me tell you a story.

36:03.325 --> 36:04.686
Why are you here?

36:06.806 --> 36:08.606
Do you want to have dinner
with me tonight?

36:13.966 --> 36:15.405
Is there something?

36:18.686 --> 36:19.846
It's Fu Yuqing, right?

36:28.405 --> 36:30.125
Was it Xu Zhi's dad who told you?

36:31.726 --> 36:32.726
No.

36:34.966 --> 36:36.686
When I took Xu Zhi home this afternoon,

36:37.365 --> 36:39.365
I heard you talking to Mr. Xu.

36:41.526 --> 36:43.445
Xu Zhi said his dad's
social circle is simple.

36:43.966 --> 36:46.125
Along with some clues
you mentioned earlier,

36:46.886 --> 36:47.886
it's not hard to guess.

36:51.205 --> 36:52.365
I never expected

36:53.405 --> 36:54.526
it's such a coincidence.

36:55.806 --> 36:57.926
Xu Zhi's father is Xu Guangji.

37:00.085 --> 37:01.966
Did you know Mr. Xu a long time ago?

37:03.526 --> 37:04.125
Yes.

37:04.526 --> 37:05.926
He's Fu Yuqing's friend.

37:06.606 --> 37:07.806
When we were young,

37:08.405 --> 37:10.405
we had a pretty good relationship.

37:11.806 --> 37:13.766
Later, I broke up with Fu Yuqing.

37:14.566 --> 37:16.005
And then I lost contact with him.

37:16.085 --> 37:17.085
Why did you break up?

37:20.205 --> 37:21.886
I was with him for several years.

37:22.566 --> 37:24.365
The relationship
was quite stable all along.

37:25.245 --> 37:27.325
So I suggested we get married.

37:34.846 --> 37:35.846
He refused?

37:39.966 --> 37:43.005
Yes, he said he was still young

37:44.886 --> 37:45.966
and didn't want to

37:46.726 --> 37:47.726
get married so soon.

37:52.045 --> 37:53.245
Since he refused,

37:53.325 --> 37:55.325
why kept her waiting for so many years?

37:55.926 --> 37:56.447
I thought,

37:56.527 --> 37:58.245
in this materialistic world,

37:58.405 --> 38:00.646
Mr. Fu was like an unpretentious jade.

38:01.445 --> 38:02.766
I didn't expect him to be so bad.

38:05.125 --> 38:07.005
The word "unpretentious"

38:07.325 --> 38:10.125
has nothing to do with him at all.

38:11.486 --> 38:12.566
Then what happened?

38:14.726 --> 38:17.205
Later, he broke up with Lian Hui.

38:17.365 --> 38:18.526
After they broke up,

38:18.686 --> 38:19.966
he had a car accident.

38:20.285 --> 38:22.285
He stayed in the hospital
for four years.

38:22.646 --> 38:25.165
In between, quite a few things happened
in his family.

38:25.405 --> 38:26.646
But he wouldn't talk about it.

38:27.526 --> 38:30.325
He even had a child with Lian Hui,

38:30.405 --> 38:31.766
and he didn't tell me.

38:32.205 --> 38:34.566
Chen Luzhou
is Ms. Lian Hui's biological child?

38:37.045 --> 38:38.045
Yes.

38:39.085 --> 38:40.606
It's so heartbreaking, even for me,

38:40.766 --> 38:42.045
let alone Chen Luzhou.

38:43.966 --> 38:45.165
Fate plays tricks on people.

38:46.606 --> 38:49.045
Mr. Fu, after taking the child back,

38:49.325 --> 38:50.526
had a car accident.

38:51.045 --> 38:52.165
Luzhou's grandma

38:52.245 --> 38:53.886
was unable to take care of him,

38:54.125 --> 38:56.085
so she had to send him to an orphanage.

39:01.045 --> 39:02.406
After Mr. Fu was discharged,

39:02.486 --> 39:04.085
did he try to find Chen Luzhou?

39:04.165 --> 39:05.165
He did.

39:05.846 --> 39:07.486
But when he went to the orphanage,

39:08.526 --> 39:09.766
the child had grown up,

39:09.846 --> 39:11.285
and couldn't recognize him.

39:11.726 --> 39:13.925
In the end, he even had to beg Lian Hui

39:14.005 --> 39:15.566
to help them reunite.

39:16.205 --> 39:17.606
Only then did Lian Hui find out

39:17.686 --> 39:19.405
Luzhou was sent to an orphanage.

39:21.245 --> 39:23.686
Mr. Fu took quite a few slaps that day.

39:36.005 --> 39:37.686
Later, he had the nerve to ask me

39:37.766 --> 39:39.686
to take him to the orphanage
to reunite with you.

39:40.766 --> 39:42.966
You know, at that moment, I clearly knew

39:43.445 --> 39:45.325
he could never be a good father.

39:47.686 --> 39:49.325
So I went to the orphanage

39:49.766 --> 39:51.005
and brought you back home.

39:52.165 --> 39:53.406
I lied to Fu Yuqing

39:53.486 --> 39:55.325
you had already been adopted
by someone else

39:55.806 --> 39:57.445
and told him to never approach me again.

40:05.045 --> 40:06.526
What's my exact birthdate?

40:08.526 --> 40:09.766
March 17.

40:10.646 --> 40:12.285
That's the birthday on your ID card.

40:12.486 --> 40:13.886
Then what is November 11?

40:14.726 --> 40:15.726
Um...

40:19.726 --> 40:21.325
The director casually picked a date

40:21.405 --> 40:23.045
when you entered

40:23.486 --> 40:25.686
the orphanage.

40:28.005 --> 40:29.005
What's wrong?

40:31.566 --> 40:32.566
It's nothing.

40:39.285 --> 40:40.686
Do you plan to acknowledge him?

40:45.566 --> 40:46.566
No need.

40:56.766 --> 40:57.766
I'm leaving.

41:17.766 --> 41:18.766
(How are you?)

41:19.726 --> 41:20.726
(Are you okay?)

41:21.165 --> 41:22.205
(You know, right?)

41:23.606 --> 41:24.606
(Where are you?)

41:25.726 --> 41:27.045
(Chen Luzhou, where are you?)

41:29.726 --> 41:31.325
(You still haven't gone home this late?)

41:56.165 --> 41:57.806
Hello, Zhi, what's up?

41:57.966 --> 41:59.886
Do you know where Chen Luzhou went?

42:00.325 --> 42:02.005
I just called him, but he didn't answer.

42:02.245 --> 42:03.245
Talk later.

42:07.285 --> 42:08.285
Hello, Li Ke.

42:08.646 --> 42:09.846
Is Chen Luzhou with you?

42:10.325 --> 42:11.325
Stop it.

42:11.726 --> 42:12.965
I'm not close with Chen Luzhou.

42:13.045 --> 42:14.045
He's your boyfriend.

42:14.125 --> 42:15.125
Why ask me?

42:15.526 --> 42:16.526
Stop messing around.

42:17.566 --> 42:18.646
I need to talk to him.

42:19.205 --> 42:20.205
Is he with you or not?

42:21.165 --> 42:22.006
He really isn't here.

42:22.086 --> 42:23.125
I'm at my hometown.

42:24.245 --> 42:26.045
Then give me Jiang Cheng's phone number.

42:26.125 --> 42:27.005
Okay, wait a moment.

42:27.085 --> 42:28.085
Alright.

42:40.766 --> 42:42.005
Is Chen Luzhou with you?

42:42.606 --> 42:43.116
Yes.

42:43.116 --> 42:44.005
Put him on the phone.

42:44.085 --> 42:45.085
I must talk to him.

42:45.325 --> 42:46.325
Chen Luzhou.

42:47.686 --> 42:48.726
He's in the bathroom.

42:50.285 --> 42:51.285
Bye.

43:19.902 --> 43:23.318
♪On a midsummer night♪

43:23.774 --> 43:28.774
♪The streetlights gradually awaken♪

43:30.142 --> 43:33.982
♪The moonlight
penetrates the tree shades♪

43:34.174 --> 43:39.006
♪Chasing the distance
between you and me♪

43:40.382 --> 43:42.829
♪On the mountaintop
where the shooting stars pass♪

43:42.942 --> 43:45.454
♪The silhouette is frozen in eternity♪

43:45.534 --> 43:47.928
♪Fireworks, cicadas chirping,
heartbeat breathing♪

43:48.190 --> 43:50.886
♪The whole world pauses♪

43:51.326 --> 43:54.299
♪Messages connecting the universe♪

43:55.902 --> 43:58.210
♪Billions of shooting stars♪

43:58.558 --> 44:01.102
♪Following the path of the galaxy♪

44:01.182 --> 44:03.598
♪Falling into your eyes♪

44:03.678 --> 44:06.190
♪Ah, ah, ah♪

44:06.270 --> 44:08.521
♪Billions of raindrops♪

44:08.702 --> 44:11.342
♪Like the universe's response♪

44:11.422 --> 44:13.897
♪Landing in my heart's depth♪

44:14.782 --> 44:17.964
♪Ah, ah, ah♪

44:18.270 --> 44:23.160
♪Ah, ah, ah♪

44:49.566 --> 44:50.126
Dad is out.

44:50.206 --> 44:51.325
Do you want to come over?

44:52.125 --> 44:53.125
Why should I go over?

44:54.045 --> 44:55.245
Let's study together.

44:55.526 --> 44:57.165
Aren't you switching majors?

44:58.566 --> 45:00.125
So I'm not attractive to you anymore?

45:00.205 --> 45:01.205
Is that so?

45:01.365 --> 45:03.045
It's not that you aren't attractive.

45:03.125 --> 45:05.005
It's just that studying
is more cost-effective.

45:05.405 --> 45:06.646
The new semester is starting.

45:07.045 --> 45:08.445
We need to focus on that.

45:09.606 --> 45:10.606
Let's improve together.

45:13.606 --> 45:14.606
I'll take a call.

45:20.405 --> 45:21.405
Hello.

45:26.886 --> 45:28.085
Okay, I'll be right there.

45:30.325 --> 45:31.806
Here, have an orange.

45:31.966 --> 45:33.285
You go ahead.

45:33.405 --> 45:34.405
Have an orange.

45:34.526 --> 45:35.365
It is quite sweet.

45:35.445 --> 45:36.445
Is it comfortable?

45:36.726 --> 45:38.365
Sitting up is better.

45:40.486 --> 45:41.486
Xu Zhi.

45:42.045 --> 45:43.285
Why did you fall again?

45:44.405 --> 45:46.566
Could it be a sequela
from the previous concussion?

45:46.646 --> 45:47.646
No.

45:47.806 --> 45:48.806
No, no.

45:49.005 --> 45:50.405
He was hit by an electric bike.

45:51.566 --> 45:52.646
Where's person at fault?

45:53.646 --> 45:55.526
He left. It was a delivery guy.

45:55.766 --> 45:57.445
Your dad didn't want
to complicate things.

45:57.686 --> 45:58.726
He looked quite anxious.

45:58.806 --> 46:00.005
So he let him go.

46:00.686 --> 46:01.607
Are you okay?

46:01.687 --> 46:03.886
Yeah, this happened on my way to work.

46:03.966 --> 46:05.005
I'll ask Cai to count it

46:05.085 --> 46:05.886
as a work injury.

46:05.966 --> 46:07.125
- Right.
- What was that?

46:07.405 --> 46:08.445
I've checked this.

46:08.646 --> 46:09.646
It can't be compensated.

46:10.005 --> 46:11.486
This morning, you did say

46:11.566 --> 46:12.407
it could.

46:12.487 --> 46:13.526
Why not now?

46:13.606 --> 46:14.606
Yeah.

46:15.165 --> 46:17.486
If you get hurt from home to work,

46:17.566 --> 46:18.566
it can be compensated.

46:18.966 --> 46:20.686
But you've gone to Songbai Road.

46:20.806 --> 46:21.527
It's so far.

46:21.607 --> 46:22.766
How do I compensate that?

46:22.886 --> 46:24.486
What's wrong with Songbai Road?

46:24.726 --> 46:26.005
I was afraid of traffic jams.

46:26.085 --> 46:27.886
I took a little detour, right?

46:28.205 --> 46:29.165
Why not go

46:29.245 --> 46:29.926
around Guangzhou

46:30.245 --> 46:31.245
or Shanghai?

46:33.445 --> 46:34.205
Mr. Cai,

46:34.365 --> 46:35.246
you are the Director.

46:35.326 --> 46:36.365
You can't be so stingy.

46:36.846 --> 46:37.526
Besides,

46:37.606 --> 46:38.206
considering

46:38.286 --> 46:40.526
I acted bravely for a just cause

46:40.686 --> 46:42.045
for our hospital last time,

46:43.125 --> 46:44.486
reimburse half of this?

46:46.806 --> 46:48.165
These are two different matters.

46:49.325 --> 46:50.325
Xu.

46:50.526 --> 46:53.405
Did you go to the bookstore
over on Songbai Road

46:53.846 --> 46:55.285
to buy comic books for Wei Lin?

46:56.125 --> 46:57.125
So it is.

46:57.566 --> 46:58.886
Running personal errands,

46:59.726 --> 47:00.486
right?

47:00.726 --> 47:01.966
Even more unacceptable.

47:02.245 --> 47:02.886
Why...

47:03.205 --> 47:04.205
What?

47:04.365 --> 47:05.365
What?

47:05.886 --> 47:06.886
Mr. Xu.

47:07.045 --> 47:08.325
- Luzhou.
- Luzhou.

47:08.405 --> 47:09.365
How's it?

47:09.445 --> 47:10.445
Is it serious?

47:10.646 --> 47:11.646
It's fine, see?

47:11.726 --> 47:12.686
Don't worry.

47:12.766 --> 47:13.567
You guys chat.

47:13.647 --> 47:14.886
I'll go fetch some hot water.

47:15.045 --> 47:16.045
Okay.

47:17.125 --> 47:18.566
Why fetch water with...

47:19.445 --> 47:21.486
- I'll go too.
- Yes, go quickly.

47:21.926 --> 47:22.606
You're fine?

47:22.686 --> 47:23.245
Yeah.

47:23.325 --> 47:24.184
Just go.

47:25.966 --> 47:28.405
And you, back to work. It's work time.

47:28.846 --> 47:30.445
I haven't asked for overtime pay.

47:30.566 --> 47:31.566
You stingy.

47:32.526 --> 47:33.526
Ungrateful.

47:33.686 --> 47:34.686
Exactly.

48:04.926 --> 48:05.926
Why are you here?

48:07.445 --> 48:09.085
I felt like you needed me, so I came.

48:11.606 --> 48:12.606
What's wrong?

48:17.285 --> 48:18.686
My dad used to go to Songbai Road

48:18.766 --> 48:19.846
only to buy me

48:20.486 --> 48:21.886
sugar pancakes.

48:22.566 --> 48:24.325
Because I was
quite a glutton as a child.

48:24.646 --> 48:26.806
My mom didn't want me
to eat too many sweets.

48:27.085 --> 48:29.245
But my dad spoiled me a lot.

48:29.566 --> 48:30.686
After work on Fridays,

48:30.766 --> 48:32.846
he would go there
to buy me sugar pancakes.

48:33.245 --> 48:34.966
And I could finish eating them

48:35.365 --> 48:36.486
before my mom returned.

48:39.125 --> 48:40.125
Come on.

48:40.365 --> 48:41.365
Have some water.

48:46.646 --> 48:47.646
Is it tasty?

48:47.926 --> 48:48.687
Yes.

48:48.767 --> 48:50.526
Dad, will you buy more for me next time?

48:50.606 --> 48:51.365
Yes, I will.

48:51.606 --> 48:52.606
Every week,

48:52.766 --> 48:55.125
I'll go to Songbai Road
to buy you sugar pancakes.

48:55.205 --> 48:56.205
Okay?

49:00.846 --> 49:02.486
Counting down two minutes, get ready.

49:02.646 --> 49:03.646
Mom is coming back soon.

49:04.205 --> 49:05.205
Hurry up and eat.

49:06.205 --> 49:07.886
Brush your teeth after eating.

49:08.245 --> 49:09.245
If your teeth go bad,

49:09.325 --> 49:10.526
your mom will scold you again.

49:16.285 --> 49:18.165
But I later found out

49:19.806 --> 49:21.646
actually Songbai Road

49:21.726 --> 49:23.085
is far from here.

49:23.886 --> 49:29.566
About half the Qingyi City away.

49:30.045 --> 49:31.285
But now,

49:32.526 --> 49:35.085
he goes there
to buy comic books for Wei Lin.

49:35.966 --> 49:38.045
I guess I've got

49:41.766 --> 49:43.405
mixed feelings.

49:46.005 --> 49:47.005
Be careful.

49:51.806 --> 49:53.686
Suddenly there are two strangers
at home.

49:54.926 --> 49:56.486
Living habits will all change.

49:58.165 --> 50:00.045
It takes time to adapt. It's normal.

50:04.926 --> 50:05.926
Look.

50:07.646 --> 50:08.646
What's wrong?

50:09.125 --> 50:10.446
I still have

50:10.526 --> 50:12.606
two functional legs for now.

50:13.285 --> 50:14.846
They should still work for long, right?

50:16.165 --> 50:17.165
And then,

50:17.926 --> 50:20.526
whether it's Songbai Road or whatnot,

50:21.165 --> 50:22.285
I can go in the future.

50:23.285 --> 50:24.285
Okay?

50:49.502 --> 50:53.134
(Shy Boy Chen, I love you.)

50:53.214 --> 51:03.448
(Me too.)

51:03.625 --> 51:09.441
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

51:09.993 --> 51:15.521
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

51:17.033 --> 51:21.481
♪The world is too quiet♪

51:22.473 --> 51:29.401
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

51:30.313 --> 51:35.401
♪Who will visit me♪

51:36.457 --> 51:42.081
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

51:42.825 --> 51:45.881
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

51:46.121 --> 51:51.441
♪Into concern and care♪

51:56.969 --> 52:02.081
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

52:02.601 --> 52:08.441
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

52:09.897 --> 52:13.281
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

52:13.417 --> 52:19.641
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

52:20.137 --> 52:23.081
♪The lonely clock♪

52:23.241 --> 52:27.841
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

52:28.233 --> 52:31.481
♪Are we both♪

52:31.753 --> 52:35.281
♪Attracted to each other♪

52:36.425 --> 52:43.041
♪Falling into you♪

52:46.761 --> 52:52.561
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

52:53.417 --> 52:56.081
♪Just a few more embraces away♪

52:56.617 --> 53:01.241
♪From reaching eternity♪

53:01.641 --> 53:04.921
♪After rushing recklessly♪

53:05.129 --> 53:08.561
♪We approach each other♪

53:09.833 --> 53:13.441
♪Without turning back♪

53:14.825 --> 53:22.481
♪In your eyes, I see myself♪

53:23.113 --> 53:29.601
♪Falling into you♪
